subssl installs its program files under /opt/subssl and the launcher as
/usr/bin/subssl. User settings, secrets and reports remain in the invoking
user's XDG directories (~/.config/subssl and ~/.local/state/subssl).

The Grafana dashboard template is installed at:
/usr/share/doc/subssl/grafana/subssl-certificates-dashboard.json

The Prometheus certificate-expiry alert rules are installed at:
/usr/share/doc/subssl/prometheus/subssl-alerts.yml
